  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Support to European Endowment for Democracy (EED) 2026 - IPA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);&quot;&gt;EED supports financially grass-roots and community based organisations, activists and emerging actors. Covering of EED&apos;s operating costs is required to help fulfil its mandate of EED. The support takes the form of annual operating grants to be renewed each year. The contract covers the year 2026 from allocation 2025 of the CSF 2024-2025 under IPA III, while combined with funds under NDICI for the Eastern and Southern Neighbourhood.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
